emoria. Ye Jiao Teng envuelve extremidades inquietas. He Huan Pi—corteza de la felicidad—abre las cortinas del pecho cuando el duelo oscurece el vagón.')); ?></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__safety"><strong><?php echo s($heartcalmtext('Do not reduce every insomnia question to a sedative:', 'No reduzcas toda pregunta de insomnio a un sedante:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($heartcalmtext('Differentiate Heat, Phlegm, Blood/Yin deficiency, Qi constraint, medicines, pain and urgent psychiatric or medical causes.', 'Diferencia Calor, Flema, deficiencia de Sangre/Yin, estancamiento de Qi, medicamentos, dolor y causas psiquiátricas o médicas urgentes.')); ?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach ($heartcalmherbs as $h): ?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($h['name']); ?><?php echo isset($h['alias']) ? s(' / ' . $h['alias']) : ''; ?></strong><em><?php echo s($h['latin']); ?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge"><?php echo s($heartcalmtext('Current category list', 'Lista vigente de la categoría')); ?></span></div><p><?php echo s($h['identity']); ?></p></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol></section>

